WEBVTT

00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:10.570
My name is Juzo Inui.

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:13.360
After the great war, the city
overflowed with Extendeds,

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:17.900
people who underwent
physical function extensions.

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:22.110
I make a living by resolving problems
that are caused by them.

00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:25.570
Some things happened and I ended up
saving a kid named Tetsuro,

00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:29.780
making me an enemy of the giant
Berühren corporation.

00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:31.610
With the help of my personal engineer Mary,

00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:35.440
the head of the extended countermeasures
department known as EMS named Olivier,

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:41.360
and even Tetsuro himself,
I've managed to get by until now.

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:47.360
One day, a man named Danny hired me
to protect a girl named Rosa.

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:52.730
In the end, I took a small
capsule as my payment.

00:00:52.730 --> 00:00:55.900
After that, I returned to my office...

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:01.900
Thanks, Tetsuro.

00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:03.820
For what, Juzo?

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:18.890
Turning Point

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:25.570
Let me ask you again.

00:01:25.570 --> 00:01:28.940
To you, what are extensions?

00:01:28.940 --> 00:01:30.820
What a stupid question!

00:01:30.820 --> 00:01:35.980
It's a weapon used to beat up people like you!

00:01:35.980 --> 00:01:39.530
A weapon... How nice.

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:46.570
Well, I guess I should take
the rest of you apart now.

00:03:24.440 --> 00:03:26.280
Hey, brats...

00:03:27.940 --> 00:03:30.440
Don't eat snacks on top of me!

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:31.860
All those crumbs!

00:03:31.860 --> 00:03:32.690
Hey!

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:35.610
Don't touch my trigger with your dirty hands!

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:37.820
This is definitely Juzo's weak point!

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:39.360
Of course not!

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:41.360
Hurry up and get offa me!

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:42.690
Darn. Boring.

00:03:42.690 --> 00:03:44.730
Even though you're just Juzo...

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:50.530
Bye!

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:54.860
Damn it. Why are there so many brats here!

00:03:54.860 --> 00:03:57.650
They used to be so scared of me.

00:03:57.650 --> 00:03:59.980
I can't search in peace...

00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:06.110
This playback device...

00:04:06.110 --> 00:04:09.190
Let me use it for a bit.

00:04:09.190 --> 00:04:13.440
Also, you should think about changing
your customer base, granny.

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:16.690
Thanks, but my customer base
is none of your business.

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:18.440
Also, no smoking here.

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:19.860
Hm?

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:21.780
It ain't lit.

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:23.070
Damn...

00:04:31.820 --> 00:04:36.940
I had gone through the trouble of pushing
Gondry over the edge he teetered over...

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:39.940
To erase the officers who came
to inspect the research facility...

00:04:39.940 --> 00:04:41.610
Granny. I'll take one of these!

00:04:41.610 --> 00:04:42.610
All right.

00:04:42.610 --> 00:04:43.610
Granny! Me, too!

00:04:43.610 --> 00:04:44.820
All right.

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:52.690
This is...

00:04:54.820 --> 00:04:58.360
"Have Guns"

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:58.360
"Inui Consulting 2F"
"Mary's Extended Examination Office 1F"

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:00.860
Ow, ow, ow.

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:04.230
Oh, my! You healed up nice.

00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:05.780
Must be your youth.

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:10.400
I can't even heal up properly from a bug bite...

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:11.980
Are you okay, Mary?

00:05:11.980 --> 00:05:14.360
Didn't you want to go with Juzo?

00:05:14.360 --> 00:05:19.030
I don't really have much
interest in the data inside.

00:05:19.030 --> 00:05:23.360
There's something that's bothering
me more than that, right now.

00:05:23.360 --> 00:05:25.400
That queer hand.

00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:27.530
Go throw it away somewhere.

00:05:27.530 --> 00:05:28.900
Is it queer?

00:05:28.900 --> 00:05:32.730
If it isn't clearly a man or a woman,
doesn't that mean it's queer?

00:05:32.730 --> 00:05:34.480
And ugly to boot!

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:36.730
That's why it's just a hand.

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:38.150
Just a hand?

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:44.070
This is a remotely controlled extension,
so the main body must be somewhere else.

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:47.320
Remotely controlled? So the user is like me...

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:48.980
No way!

00:05:48.980 --> 00:05:53.820
The reason Harmony is special is
because it can hack into the sub-brain.

00:05:53.820 --> 00:05:58.320
The ability to control something
remotely is pretty common.

00:05:59.530 --> 00:06:01.900
Well, that's not our thing.

00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:03.900
Okay, perfect!

00:06:03.900 --> 00:06:08.530
Its joints were getting loose,
so I fixed them up a bit.

00:06:11.940 --> 00:06:14.320
You're a strange one, too.

00:06:14.320 --> 00:06:17.440
You keep doing work that
doesn't make you any money.

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:21.280
You can't really complain about Juzo.

00:06:21.280 --> 00:06:24.400
A certain engineer told me once,

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:28.860
"An Extended is someone who has lost
something valuable in their life.

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:33.690
That's why we can't take anything
more away from them."

00:06:33.690 --> 00:06:37.190
Even so, people can't live without money.

00:06:37.190 --> 00:06:40.610
In my case, I take money where I can!

00:06:40.610 --> 00:06:42.070
Like from Juzo!

00:06:42.070 --> 00:06:48.230
I suddenly feel embarrassed about
my own existence. I wonder why?

00:06:48.230 --> 00:06:50.400
That engineer...

00:06:51.570 --> 00:06:54.780
Yeah, yeah. I'm coming!

00:06:54.860 --> 00:06:57.860
"Have Guns"

00:06:56.940 --> 00:06:57.860
"Inui Consulting 2F"
"Mary's Extended Examination Office 1F"

00:06:58.190 --> 00:07:00.610
Hello, Inui Consul--

00:07:02.610 --> 00:07:05.980
Huh? Ah! This voice!

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:08.440
The lip woman from EMS!

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:13.150
And you must be Juzo's personal engineer.

00:07:13.150 --> 00:07:18.940
Tell that EMS woman to replace the guards
outside with more handsome ones!

00:07:18.940 --> 00:07:22.400
What do you need? Juzo isn't here right now.

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:25.320
He's gone? At a time like this...

00:07:25.320 --> 00:07:28.980
Just hurry up and get everyone out of there.

00:07:28.980 --> 00:07:30.400
If you don't hurry, they'll--

00:07:34.780 --> 00:07:36.480
What is it, Mary?

00:07:36.480 --> 00:07:39.070
Oh. No... Just now...

00:07:40.360 --> 00:07:41.570
Huh?

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:47.070
Mary?!

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:53.980
Wh-What in the world is this?!

00:07:53.980 --> 00:07:55.900
Boy! Chris!

00:07:58.570 --> 00:07:59.780
What just--

00:07:59.780 --> 00:08:02.280
Be quiet! Chris, this way!

00:08:02.280 --> 00:08:04.070
I can't... I can't see!

00:08:04.070 --> 00:08:06.820
It's okay! I'm here with you!

00:08:23.570 --> 00:08:26.190
Both of you, stand back.

00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:31.530
What's going on?! Weren't the EMS
guards supposed to be protecting us?!

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:33.650
They should have been...

00:08:45.440 --> 00:08:48.110
E-Electricity?!

00:08:48.110 --> 00:08:50.570
It's a trap for intruders.

00:08:50.570 --> 00:08:53.280
It's not enough to kill them, so no worries!

00:08:53.280 --> 00:08:55.570
For now, we need to run!

00:08:57.940 --> 00:08:59.530
This side, too?

00:09:01.320 --> 00:09:02.280
Chris!

00:09:02.280 --> 00:09:03.690
Boy! This way.

00:09:03.690 --> 00:09:04.900
Mary!

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:07.860
Wait, Mary!

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:11.980
Chris was caught! We have to save Chris!

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:15.980
But our enemies are fully armed
and they were all normal people!

00:09:15.980 --> 00:09:17.230
Huh?!

00:09:19.860 --> 00:09:23.190
Harmony won't work against
people that don't have a sub-brain!

00:09:23.190 --> 00:09:29.480
They aren't people that you nor I can handle!

00:09:29.480 --> 00:09:35.400
And we don't know who they are or what
they want. It's too dangerous.

00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:39.190
At the very least, I'm sure that
Chris wasn't their target.

00:09:39.190 --> 00:09:41.530
First, we need to get in contact with Juzo!

00:09:44.030 --> 00:09:46.610
Mary. That's...

00:09:48.070 --> 00:09:49.320
They're...

00:09:49.320 --> 00:09:52.150
Weren't they the people guarding us?!

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:53.940
I'm sure you're right!

00:09:57.480 --> 00:09:59.190
This one is still alive!

00:09:59.190 --> 00:10:00.820
Hang in there!

00:10:00.820 --> 00:10:04.150
It's all right! These wounds aren't fatal!

00:10:04.150 --> 00:10:06.190
I'm going to borrow his body.

00:10:06.190 --> 00:10:07.480
Huh?

00:10:07.480 --> 00:10:09.730
I'll go and save Chris with that body.

00:10:09.730 --> 00:10:11.360
What are you saying?!

00:10:11.360 --> 00:10:13.860
This person is heavily wounded!

00:10:13.860 --> 00:10:20.440
The more you resonate with the body
you control, the more your body is affected.

00:10:20.440 --> 00:10:24.900
If the body you are controlling
gets a fatal wound, you could...

00:10:26.070 --> 00:10:27.280
I know.

00:10:28.820 --> 00:10:33.570
The feeling of what was
once Colt disappearing...

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:40.650
If only...I had used my powers
better from the beginning...

00:10:40.650 --> 00:10:43.570
...Colt wouldn't have died.

00:10:43.570 --> 00:10:48.150
If I can avoid experiencing that again...

00:10:48.150 --> 00:10:55.150
...I won't hesitate using someone
or using my powers, ever again!

00:10:56.440 --> 00:10:58.980
B-Boy...

00:11:05.900 --> 00:11:08.730
Please move, Mary.

00:11:10.070 --> 00:11:12.690
Mary! Please move!

00:11:12.690 --> 00:11:20.860
I won't. As an engineer... I can't
allow you to use Harmony right now!

00:11:27.650 --> 00:11:30.780
Boy! You can't go back!

00:11:34.820 --> 00:11:38.610
Let go! Let me go! Let go!

00:11:40.530 --> 00:11:41.730
Tetsuro!

00:11:41.730 --> 00:11:45.440
What a dumbass kid,
coming right back just to get caught.

00:11:45.440 --> 00:11:48.280
What happened to the woman
who ran away with you?

00:11:48.280 --> 00:11:50.730
I'm your target, right?!

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:52.940
Don't touch the others!

00:11:52.940 --> 00:11:54.030
Hm?

00:11:54.030 --> 00:11:56.030
So, you're the one that has it?

00:11:56.030 --> 00:11:57.900
The data?

00:11:57.900 --> 00:12:00.400
Data? Aren't you guys from Berü--

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:04.730
Tetsuro. These people are from the
anti-extension group, Spitzbergen.

00:12:04.730 --> 00:12:07.190
Spitzbergen?!

00:12:07.190 --> 00:12:11.150
That's right. They're trying to
steal the data that Juzo has!

00:12:12.280 --> 00:12:13.480
Chris!

00:12:13.480 --> 00:12:15.030
Don't say unnecessary things.

00:12:15.030 --> 00:12:16.820
Stop it!

00:12:16.820 --> 00:12:18.530
You shitty brat!

00:12:20.030 --> 00:12:22.030
Shimazu...

00:12:22.030 --> 00:12:24.690
This kid is an Extended, you know?

00:12:27.730 --> 00:12:29.730
Fine. Fine.

00:12:32.030 --> 00:12:35.360
You're all hostages for the Resolver.

00:12:35.360 --> 00:12:39.400
We'll let you go once we get
what we want, so be good.

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:44.690
Chris, I'm sorry.

00:12:44.690 --> 00:12:47.570
What are you saying? It'll be fine.

00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:51.190
Juzo will save us soon.

00:12:51.190 --> 00:12:53.480
We captured hostages.

00:12:53.480 --> 00:12:57.610
But it seems that Resolver
has the data as we thought.

00:12:58.780 --> 00:12:59.860
Shut up.

00:12:59.860 --> 00:13:02.320
There's no need for that bastard!

00:13:02.320 --> 00:13:05.480
We don't need the power of an Extended!

00:13:05.480 --> 00:13:08.530
Shimazu and I will track down
the woman who ran away.

00:13:08.530 --> 00:13:09.820
Got it?

00:13:13.820 --> 00:13:15.820
This is bad.

00:13:15.820 --> 00:13:19.190
Juzo, where did you go?

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:20.400
Huh?

00:13:23.610 --> 00:13:25.360
Where are you going?!

00:13:28.610 --> 00:13:30.440
What is it?!

00:13:34.230 --> 00:13:36.650
There's something ahead, isn't there?

00:13:36.650 --> 00:13:39.480
You're trying to lead me there!

00:13:48.070 --> 00:13:53.570
I can't believe you're working
as an extension engineer...

00:13:57.030 --> 00:14:00.820
What a disappointment, Mary.

00:14:02.820 --> 00:14:06.230
Victor?

00:14:06.230 --> 00:14:10.900
Soon, a calamity will fall
upon all the Extended.

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:15.570
Don't get involved with the Extended anymore.

00:14:19.190 --> 00:14:20.730
Wait!

00:14:20.730 --> 00:14:22.650
Hold on a second!

00:14:24.280 --> 00:14:26.190
Brother...

00:14:36.190 --> 00:14:38.320
What's this?

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:41.940
Juzo...

00:14:44.030 --> 00:14:45.530
Mary...

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:51.820
"Cheap Extensions"
"Café One Way"

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:50.940
You did something very stupid.

00:14:50.940 --> 00:14:55.280
I can't believe you announced the
location of the data in public.

00:14:55.280 --> 00:14:59.690
Why did Rosa's father have a
recording of <i>that</i> man's voice?

00:15:01.570 --> 00:15:05.110
That was something I sent him.

00:15:05.110 --> 00:15:11.900
George McMahon was the most
trustworthy prosecutor that I knew.

00:15:11.900 --> 00:15:18.860
The original data I had with me
was destroyed... along with Armed.

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:25.110
The copy you sent him has become
the only physical proof left.

00:15:25.110 --> 00:15:26.320
Yes.

00:15:26.320 --> 00:15:31.530
McMahon realized the importance of
that data and protected it with his life.

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:35.190
I'm sure you realized it after
hearing that recording.

00:15:35.190 --> 00:15:40.030
That was the symbol of Extended,
the hero Mega Armed Tokisada,

00:15:40.030 --> 00:15:42.690
confessing to a past crime.

00:15:42.690 --> 00:15:46.780
Extension technology propelled
this country forward dramatically,

00:15:46.780 --> 00:15:49.400
while also bringing profit to the people.

00:15:49.400 --> 00:15:54.320
The rare instances of an Extended going
berserk was a problem with the person.

00:15:54.320 --> 00:15:57.780
The safety of extension
technology was absolute.

00:15:57.780 --> 00:16:02.940
But that was a desperate lie made by
Berühren and the government.

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:06.780
And their symbol was Mega Armed Tokisada.

00:16:06.780 --> 00:16:11.150
If his confession gets thoughtlessly released
to the public, it won't be just Berühren.

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:13.900
This whole country may be shaken.

00:16:13.900 --> 00:16:18.530
Even so, you don't plan on
covering this up, do you?

00:16:18.530 --> 00:16:19.780
Of course not.

00:16:19.780 --> 00:16:21.650
But this case...

00:16:22.900 --> 00:16:27.650
We have to tread carefully
and punish them lawfully.

00:16:27.650 --> 00:16:29.780
So, give me back that data--

00:16:29.780 --> 00:16:32.230
Got the jist of it. See ya.

00:16:32.230 --> 00:16:33.940
Hey! Juzo!

00:16:45.480 --> 00:16:48.900
You must be Miss Mary.

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:51.190
I am sorry for bothering you
when you seem so tired,

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:54.030
but I would like to speak with you for a moment.

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:55.360
Who are you?

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:56.860
Pardon me.

00:16:56.860 --> 00:17:01.110
I am from the third public safety unit of
the Reconstruction Agency, Avi Cobo.

00:17:01.110 --> 00:17:05.480
Due to the recent Gondry case,
I am also working as a substitute

00:17:05.480 --> 00:17:09.400
for the EMS director that was recently removed.

00:17:12.820 --> 00:17:15.190
Ugh, it's too damp.

00:17:15.190 --> 00:17:16.980
It won't light.

00:17:16.980 --> 00:17:21.860
There is no mistake that the
man you met was this man?

00:17:23.650 --> 00:17:26.440
Did that man say anything to you?

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:30.530
What did that person do?

00:17:30.530 --> 00:17:32.440
Victor Steinberg.

00:17:32.440 --> 00:17:35.650
Age unknown. Background unknown.

00:17:35.650 --> 00:17:40.690
He is one of the few Extended within the
anti-extension group, Spitzbergen.

00:17:40.690 --> 00:17:43.860
We believe he is a part of
the terrorist attack unit.

00:17:45.030 --> 00:17:47.110
Spitzbergen...?

00:17:47.110 --> 00:17:53.320
His mastery with extensions allows him to
pull Extended bodies apart instantaneously.

00:17:53.320 --> 00:17:57.730
He is so quick and accurate that the
victim doesn't even realize it's happening.

00:17:57.730 --> 00:18:03.480
His cruel methods have earned
him the nickname, Dismantler.

00:18:03.480 --> 00:18:07.610
He is the natural enemy of all Extended.

00:18:09.610 --> 00:18:11.230
Victor is?!

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:17.280
No way! I can't believe he
would do something... like that.

00:18:18.570 --> 00:18:23.820
I have been investigating
Victor for a long time.

00:18:23.820 --> 00:18:28.690
We received information that the terrorist
attack unit has a base in the Kyusei Pit.

00:18:28.690 --> 00:18:30.530
Really?!

00:18:30.530 --> 00:18:33.730
We still do not have their exact location.

00:18:33.730 --> 00:18:40.190
It would be difficult for us to enter
the Kyusei Pit without solid evidence.

00:18:40.190 --> 00:18:44.570
To begin with, common sense
does not work with Spitzbergen.

00:18:44.570 --> 00:18:52.980
It is unfortunate, but I doubt the ones
they kidnapped will make it back alive.

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:59.730
This case... We are also at fault.

00:18:59.730 --> 00:19:01.320
Our apologies.

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:03.030
Wait, that's--

00:19:03.030 --> 00:19:05.440
Don't misunderstand.

00:19:05.440 --> 00:19:08.400
It's not your agency's fault.

00:19:08.400 --> 00:19:12.150
I don't need any empty apologies.

00:19:12.150 --> 00:19:14.320
How harsh.

00:19:14.320 --> 00:19:21.860
However... It would be different if you
had <i>something</i> to bargain with.

00:19:25.570 --> 00:19:27.690
That data.

00:19:27.690 --> 00:19:30.190
We will take it off your hands.

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:33.650
Please leave the rest of it to us.

00:19:33.650 --> 00:19:41.230
You say that, but you all just want the data!
You don't care about the hostages!

00:19:41.230 --> 00:19:43.610
Your concern has really moved my heart.

00:19:43.610 --> 00:19:48.400
But I already sold the data you're
looking for to get paid for my last job.

00:19:48.400 --> 00:19:51.480
Didn't get much for it though.

00:19:51.480 --> 00:19:55.070
As expected of the rumored Resolver, Juzo.

00:19:55.070 --> 00:20:01.070
You seem quite calm, even though your
friends were captured by terrorists.

00:20:01.070 --> 00:20:03.940
Calm, huh?

00:20:06.530 --> 00:20:12.860
That must be the case, if that's how I look.

00:20:15.610 --> 00:20:17.730
Let us leave it at that for now.

00:20:17.730 --> 00:20:21.980
Please contact us if you notice anything.

00:20:21.980 --> 00:20:24.360
Then, that is all for today.

00:20:27.190 --> 00:20:28.570
Is that okay?!

00:20:28.570 --> 00:20:34.070
That Over-Extended
definitely still has that data.

00:20:34.070 --> 00:20:38.400
It seems the muzzle of the gun is wavering
with uncertainty and impatience.

00:20:38.400 --> 00:20:40.030
Huh?

00:20:40.030 --> 00:20:42.480
If you touch things carelessly,
you'll get burnt.

00:20:43.730 --> 00:20:45.570
More importantly, that girl.

00:20:45.570 --> 00:20:48.570
I'm sure of it. That is Victor's little sister.

00:20:48.570 --> 00:20:49.780
Huh?!

00:20:50.190 --> 00:20:53.780
I'm sure she'll come in
contact with Victor again.

00:20:53.780 --> 00:20:56.190
Don't take your eyes off of her.

00:22:45.860 --> 00:22:47.650
Both of you. Get out!

00:22:47.650 --> 00:22:49.690
Wh-Where in the world are we?!

00:22:49.690 --> 00:22:51.360
Hurry up and get out!

00:22:58.030 --> 00:22:59.980
Don't look around!

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:01.230
Hey!

00:23:01.230 --> 00:23:02.980
I won't forgive any violence!

00:23:02.980 --> 00:23:05.730
Hey! Ow, ow, ow, ow! That hurts!

00:23:05.730 --> 00:23:09.190
You guys are nothing to Juzo!

00:23:09.190 --> 00:23:11.530
Understand?!

00:23:27.400 --> 00:23:29.570
You haven't changed at all...

00:23:28.030 --> 00:23:30.610
We were destined to become enemies.

00:23:29.570 --> 00:23:32.230
name is Wachowski.

00:23:30.610 --> 00:23:35.400
That was the first job I ever accepted.

00:23:32.230 --> 00:23:35.400
Victor disappeared after that.

00:23:35.350 --> 00:23:41.980
<i>NO GUNS LIFE</i> . Episode 14.
